=[ Tomet Web Editor ]

Interactive web playground for the @link[Tomet](https://github.com/tomet-lang/tomet) markup language, built with **Svelte 5** and **CodeMirror 6**, powered by WebAssembly (`@tomet/wasm`) and AST components (`@tomet/svelte`).

==[ Features ]

-| **Client-side WebAssembly parsing** via `@tomet/wasm`.
-| **Interactive Svelte 5 AST rendering** via `@tomet/svelte`.
-| **CodeMirror 6 Editor** with syntax highlighting and linting.
-| **Real-time multi-view**:
   -. Svelte Preview (interactive component rendering)
   -. HTML Preview
   -. AST Tree & AST JSON
   -. CommonMark Markdown export
   -. Typst markup export
-| **Lossless source formatting**.

==[ Development ]

=== Install dependencies
```bash
pnpm install
```

=== Start development server
```bash
pnpm dev
```

=== Build for production
```bash
pnpm build
pnpm preview
```

